<DocsLayout lang="en" title="Getting started" description="Render a Shumoku network topology.">
  <h1>Getting started</h1>
  <p>Install the CLI, save a topology, and render it to SVG.</p>
  <pre><code>npm install --global @shumoku/cli
shumoku render network.yaml -o network.svg</code></pre>
  <p>
    The website and interactive playground remain available separately while this static
    documentation evolves.
  </p>
</DocsLayout>
